From: ios-mh2lm
Subject: mh2lm: separate FG observer routes from protocol write ownership

Use the v5 observer mapping policy for fixed FG reads. Preflight every
protocol writer before session mutations and retain per-update ownership
checks. Report first failure address/operation and independently valid
capacity/watchdog/configuration evidence without enabling charge control.

